        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions New Contemporary Appliance / Refrigerator Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nDress up your freezers and refrigerators with this all new two tone contemporary appliance pull. The main section of the pull handle is made of Stainless Steel, with Frosted Acrylic ends for a stunning new combination design.   \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CFRBTTAF-detailed-view.jpg?v=1704442268\" width=580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acrylic and Stainless Pull Detailed View\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIt is packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator / appliance door panel. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions CFRBTTAF Acrylic and Stainless Steel Appliance Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li><b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> Finish</li>\r\n<li>Pull End Material: Finest Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter at Base: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for appliance panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 different lengths.</b>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBTTAF/18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount - 10\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBTTAF/22: Total Length 22\" - Center to Center Mount - 12\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBTTAF/30: Total Length 30\" - Center to Center Mount - 20\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBTTAF/36: Total Length 36\" - Center to Center Mount - 26\"</li>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This stainless steel appliance handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the appliance handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a standard 3/4\" - 1\" thick refrigerator/appliance door panel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
